{"ref":"BDB, מִיכָיָה","hw":"מִיכָיָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִיכָיָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  the canon. prophet, Micah, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 26:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.26.18\">Je 26:18</a> Kt (Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">מִיכָה</span>, as <a data-ref=\"Micah 1:1\" href=\"/Micah.1.1\">Mi 1:1</a>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:35\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.35\">Ne 12:35</a> (called <span dir=\"rtl\">מִיכָא</span>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:17\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.17\">11:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:22\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.22\">22</a>).<br><strong>3.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:41\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.41\">Ne 12:41</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"II Kings 22:12\" href=\"/II_Kings.22.12\">2 K 22:12</a> (‖ <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:20\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.20\">2 Ch 34:20</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">מִיכָה</span>).","next":"BDB, מִיכָה","prev":"BDB, מִיכָֽיְהוּ"}